{"type":"after","callId":"call@255","endTime":150407.128,"result":{"snapshot":"- generic [ref=e2]:\n  - link \"Skip to main content\" [ref=e3] [cursor=pointer]:\n    - /url: \"#main-content\"\n  - complementary \"Coach workspace account\" [ref=e4]:\n    - link \"Northline Golf Coaching Roadmap home\" [ref=e226] [cursor=pointer]:\n      - /url: /app\n      - generic [ref=e6]: NG\n      - generic [ref=e7]:\n        - strong [ref=e8]: Northline Golf Coaching\n        - generic [ref=e9]: Roadmap coach workspace\n    - navigation \"Coach workspace\" [ref=e10]:\n      - link \"Overview\" [ref=e11] [cursor=pointer]:\n        - /url: /app\n      - link \"Golfers\" [ref=e12] [cursor=pointer]:\n        - /url: /app/golfers\n      - link \"Drill library\" [ref=e13] [cursor=pointer]:\n        - /url: /app/coaching/drills\n      - link \"Roadmap templates\" [ref=e14] [cursor=pointer]:\n        - /url: /app/coaching/roadmaps\n      - link \"Media\" [ref=e15] [cursor=pointer]:\n        - /url: /app/media\n      - link \"Packages\" [ref=e16] [cursor=pointer]:\n        - /url: /app/packages\n      - link \"Plan & billing\" [ref=e17] [cursor=pointer]:\n        - /url: /app/billing\n      - link \"Settings\" [ref=e18] [cursor=pointer]:\n        - /url: /app/settings\n    - generic [ref=e19]:\n      - generic [ref=e20]: CA\n      - generic [ref=e21]:\n        - strong [ref=e22]: Coach Avery North\n        - generic [ref=e23]: qa.fresh@example.test\n      - button \"Sign out\" [ref=e25] [cursor=pointer]\n  - main [ref=e26]:\n    - generic [ref=e27]:\n      - generic [ref=e29]:\n        - generic [ref=e30]: Coaching packages\n        - heading \"Connect the phase to a package you already offer.\" [level=1] [ref=e262]\n        - paragraph [ref=e32]: Roadmap explains the recommendation and then sends the golfer to your existing booking, purchase, or contact route. It does not process coach-package payments.\n      - note [ref=e263]:\n        - strong [ref=e264]: Package facts can affect private golfer plans.\n        - generic [ref=e265]: Editing or archiving a linked package creates a new withdrawn plan revision, clears publication approval, and revokes active links until you review and publish again. Roadmap never treats an external click as a booking, purchase, or sale.\n      - generic [ref=e298]:\n        - heading \"Current packages\" [level=2] [ref=e300]\n        - list [ref=e301]:\n          - listitem [ref=e302]:\n            - generic [ref=e303]:\n              - strong [ref=e304]: Foundation rebuild\n              - generic [ref=e305]: A structured three-phase coaching block for rebuilding contact and confidence.\n              - generic [ref=e306]: CAD 720.00 · Four sessions used within ten weeks. Rescheduling requires 24 hours notice.\n            - generic [ref=e307]: active\n            - generic [ref=e308]:\n              - group [ref=e309]:\n                - generic \"Edit or archive this package\" [ref=e310]\n                - option \"Active\" [selected]\n                - option \"Draft\"\n                - option \"Booking\" [selected]\n                - option \"Purchase\"\n                - option \"Contact\"\n                - option \"Other\"\n              - alert [ref=e311]\n      - generic [ref=e266]:\n        - group \"Add a package you already sell\" [ref=e268]:\n          - generic [ref=e270]:\n            - generic [ref=e271]:\n              - text: Package name\n              - textbox \"Package name\" [disabled] [ref=e272]\n            - generic [ref=e273]:\n              - text: Why it fits\n              - textbox \"Why it fits\" [disabled] [ref=e274]\n            - generic [ref=e275]:\n              - text: Price in CAD (optional)\n              - spinbutton \"Price in CAD (optional) This is the instructor’s coaching-package price, not the Roadmap subscription.\" [disabled] [ref=e276]\n              - generic [ref=e277]: This is the instructor’s coaching-package price, not the Roadmap subscription.\n            - generic [ref=e278]:\n              - text: Current details when no price is shown\n              - textbox \"Current details when no price is shown Provide either an exact price or an honest current-details message.\" [disabled] [ref=e279]:\n                - /placeholder: Confirm current price with me\n              - generic [ref=e280]: Provide either an exact price or an honest current-details message.\n            - generic [ref=e281]:\n              - text: Material inclusions — one per line\n              - textbox \"Material inclusions — one per line List only what this package currently includes. Do not imply booking or payment has occurred.\" [disabled] [ref=e282]:\n                - /placeholder: \"Four individual lessons\\nWritten practice direction\\nEnd-of-phase review\"\n              - generic [ref=e283]: List only what this package currently includes. Do not imply booking or payment has occurred.\n            - generic [ref=e284]:\n              - text: Cadence (optional)\n              - textbox \"Cadence (optional)\" [disabled] [ref=e285]:\n                - /placeholder: Four lessons over six to eight weeks\n            - generic [ref=e286]:\n              - text: Practice expectation (optional)\n              - textbox \"Practice expectation (optional)\" [disabled] [ref=e287]\n            - generic [ref=e288]:\n              - text: Evaluation approach (optional)\n              - textbox \"Evaluation approach (optional)\" [disabled] [ref=e289]\n            - generic [ref=e290]:\n              - text: Terms\n              - textbox \"Terms\" [disabled] [ref=e291]:\n                - /placeholder: Sessions, expected window, expiry, rescheduling, and renewal terms.\n            - generic [ref=e292]:\n              - text: Existing HTTPS booking, purchase, or contact link\n              - textbox \"Existing HTTPS booking, purchase, or contact link Roadmap makes the handoff clear; it does not claim the external action completed.\" [disabled] [ref=e293]\n              - generic [ref=e294]: Roadmap makes the handoff clear; it does not claim the external action completed.\n        - alert [ref=e295]\n        - status [ref=e312]: Package saved. It can now be connected to a coaching phase.\n        - button \"Save package\" [disabled] [ref=e297]"}}
