        - strong [ref=e384]: Collect only what you need.\n        - generic [ref=e385]: Do not add medical details, payment information, or unrelated personal history. Media is optional and requires a suitable consent basis.\n      - region [ref=e386]:\n        - generic [ref=e388]:\n          - generic [ref=e389]: Authorization control\n          - heading \"Golfer record processing\" [level=2] [ref=e390]\n        - paragraph [ref=e391]: Synthetic authorization for test-only golfer records; no real person is represented.\n        - paragraph [ref=e392]: \"Policy version: synthetic-golfer-record-v1\"\n        - paragraph [ref=e393]: \"Current state: authorized\"\n        - button \"Withdraw authorization\" [ref=e394] [cursor=pointer]\n      - region [ref=e395]:\n        - generic [ref=e396]:\n          - generic [ref=e397]:\n            - generic [ref=e398]: Step 1 of 7\n            - heading \"Save the golfer and goal.\" [level=2] [ref=e399]\n            - paragraph [ref=e400]: This is the durable first step. Assessment, priority, phases, optional evidence, package, and exact preview follow on the resumable route.\n          - generic [ref=e401]: Saved only after confirmation\n        - generic [ref=e402]:\n          - status [ref=e403]:\n            - generic [ref=e404]:\n              - strong [ref=e405]: Goal-step save state\n              - generic [ref=e406]: The server confirmed the golfer and goal. Opening the next step…\n          - group \"Save the real basics first\" [ref=e408]:\n            - paragraph [ref=e410]: This creates a private, resumable record with no invented assessment, priority, phase, or package content. It cannot be previewed or published until you finish the coaching roadmap.\n            - generic [ref=e411]:\n              - generic [ref=e412]:\n                - text: Golfer display name\n                - textbox \"Golfer display name\" [disabled] [ref=e413]: Jordan Rivers\n              - generic [ref=e414]:\n                - text: